			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νόσοι, νοσήματα ἐ.</span>,
